    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Contrairement à",
     "texto": [
      "**Contrairement à** + noun or pronoun (unlike): **Contrairement à moi, tu aimes le sport** (unlike me, you like sport).",
      "With a verb use **contrairement à ce que** + clause: **Contrairement à ce que je pense** (contrary to what I think)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "À l'inverse, au contraire",
     "texto": [
      "**À l'inverse** (the other way round) and **au contraire** (on the contrary) change the idea: **Moi, au contraire, je déteste le sport** (me, on the other hand, I hate sport)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
